Masterwork_CompleteRule=A Masterwork can be completed by taking the Perform Experiment action and paying all of its costs.
Masterwork_Completing_Lead=If you are completing a Masterwork, 
Masterwork_NamePrompt=Give your creation a new, majestic name:
Masterwork_RequiresExperimentsNote=_Note: This Masterwork still requires 1 A Experiment, 2 B Experiments, and 3 C Experiments to be completed._
