Resource_InsanityTrack_3rdSpace_Lead=If a player reaches the **3rd** space on the {icon:insanity_icon} Track, 
Resource_KnowledgeMovesCreepyTrack_Rule=At the end of each round, each player will **move one space forward on the** {icon:creepy_icon} **Track for each Knowledge cube in their Estate**.
Reward_BidWinnerGain4VP=The player who won the bid gains **4VP** and pays their money to the supply.
Reward_EitherWayGain4VP=Either way, they will also **gain 4VP**.
Reward_Gain3VP=**Gain 3VP**.
Reward_ImmediatelyGain1VP=**Immediately gain 1VP.**
Reward_InsanityTrackSpace_5VP=At the end of the Generation, if your piece is on space {mental} of the {icon:insanity_icon} Track, you will **gain 5VP**.
Reward_LeastCreepy_NobelPrize_Lose7VP=At the End of the Generation, the **least** {icon:creepy_icon} player will be awarded this prestigious award and **lose 7VP.**
Reward_MostBricks_KeyToCity=At the End of the Generation, the player who has the most bricks receives the **Key to the City** Upgrade. _Ties are broken by the one with the fewest VP._ 
Reward_MostHeartTokens_5VP=At the end of the Generation, the player with the most {icon:s1_hearttoken} tokens will gain **5VP.** _If there is a tie, all tied players gain 5VP._
Reward_MostMentypeExperiments_Menagerie=At the End of the Generation, the player who has completed the most {mentype} Experiments receives the **Menagerie** Upgrade. _Ties are broken by the one with the fewest VP._ 
Reward_MostOccultExperiments_CabinetOfCuriosities=At the End of the Generation, the player with the most completed **Occult** Experiments gains the **Cabinet of Curiosities** Vanity Estate Upgrade. 
Reward_MostOccultExperiments_SpawningPods=At the end of the Generation, the player with the most completed **Occult** Experiments will receive the **Spawning Pods** Vanity Estate Upgrade.
Reward_SecondMostBricks=The player who has the second-most bricks will also receive this Upgrade.
Reward_SecondMostExperiments_HasVariant=The player who has the second-most Experiments will also receive this Upgrade.
Reward_SecondMostExperiments_WithVariant=The player with the second-most Experiments will also receive this Upgrade.
Round_EndOfRoundActions_Rule=Perform any End of Round actions before continuing.
