Vote_TallyRule_A=When all players have chosen, all players reveal their votes. Tally all the votes and the side with the most votes wins. _Ties are broken by the last player in turn order._
Vote_TallyRule_B=Once all players have chosen, they all reveal their votes. Tally the votes and the side with the most votes wins. _Ties are broken by the last player in turn order._
Vote_TallyRule_C=Tally all the votes and the side with the most votes wins. _Ties are broken by the last player in turn order._
Vote_TieBreakNote_A=_(Ties are broken, by the last player in turn order.)_
Vote_YayMeaning_Hunt=A **Yay** vote is a vote to **contribute** to the Hunt.
Voting_Instructions=Click on the 'Start Voting' button to start the vote. This will start a 3-second countdown.
